        "number_of_reviews": 2,
        "owner_reply": "Hello,\nWe’re sorry to hear about your concerns and understand your hesitation.\nTo help us properly review your case and provide accurate assistance, could you please kindly share your order number? Alternatively, you may also email your details to us at service@cs.halara.com, and our team will be happy to look into this for you.\nWe appreciate your feedback and the opportunity to clarify any misunderstandings.",
